# PurviewTeamsPstToHtmlApp

This folder is a **standalone Cursor project** for the Purview Teams PST→HTML converter.

## Paths

- **Project root (source):** this repository (`PurviewTeamsPstToHtmlApp`)
- **Build output:** `build/` (gitignored EXEs)
- **User deliverables:** `C:\Users\pbush\OneDrive - Perfection Learning\Documents\AI\Cursor Output\PurviewTeamsPstToHtmlApp`
- **Do not modify:** `...\Hermes Working Directory\PurviewTeamsPstToHtmlApp` (originals)

## Build

```powershell
pwsh -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\build.ps1 -Version <x.y.z.w>
```

Then copy EXEs from `build\` to the Cursor Output folder above.

## Architecture

- **Core:** `src\Convert-PurviewTeamsPstToHtml.ps1` (PowerShell 7, `-Sta`, Outlook COM)
- **Launcher:** `src\Start-PurviewTeamsPstToHtmlApp.ps1` (WinForms, embeds core as Base64)
- After core changes, always re-embed via `build.ps1` before shipping EXEs.

## Conventions

- Prefer in-memory PST read path (T13 disk-spill was reverted for speed).
- Detach only PSTs this run attached; leave pre-existing attachments alone.
- Sample-data smoke: `-NoGui -UseSampleData`, expect `exported=3`.
